        <briefdescription>
<para>Loads a default font from the specified file. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function reads in a font file and populates the atlas texture with its data. The font file should be in the <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_a_g_e_font" kindref="compound">AGEFont</ref> format, which includes information about the font name, version number, asset ID, texture specification, and raw bytes of the texture data. If the header does not match &quot;AGEFont&quot;, an error message is logged and the function returns early.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>FontName</parametername>
